        "parameters": {
          "toolDescription": "Use this tool ONLY to fetch the raw text or HTML content of a competitor's pricing webpage. You must supply a single, valid, absolute URL (e.g., 'https://n8n.io/pricing') as the parameter. Do not pass search keywords or incomplete domains. Use this tool only after you have identified the exact pricing URL.",
